From 74c3e40c0dddc546c3c8de12f820fe74292c4452 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Oct 2025 14:30:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 180/190] drm: xlnx: mmi-dc: Publish hw compositor interface

commit 3fbc907d5180264eadf653d052123670960f8340 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Make hw compositor (avbuf + blender) interface accessible outside 0f the
video plane context. Refactor MMI DC format to cache CSC configuration.
Introduce few format flags required to program hw compositor.

Signed-off-by: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Vishal Sagar <vishal.sagar@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20251023213014.683122-3-anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
